{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03CDD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"El Colibrí是个难缠的对手。不过，应该有办法打倒它。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"尤其那里似乎有很多藏身之处。和对付普通直升机时一样，游击战术应该有效。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不过，不能小看它的攻击力。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"是啊。它说不定连遗迹里的柱子都能轰飞。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"还有，也要小心绑走Chico的那种小型飞行器——Chicolibrí。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"Chicolibrí……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":20,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"意思是“Colibrí之子”。要是被它抓住，就只能拼命挣扎。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":77,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"运气好的话，也许能逃出来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不过最好还是别让它抓住。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"嗯。那样最好。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""}]}